{"committed":false,"index":0,"integrated":false,"layer":0,"role":"coder","sealed":false,"session":"8064fbe8cac14cfab2ccede9edb399d7","task":"## Section (untitled)\nWrite the book described in book/chlo/scaffold.toml (title: ULTRA SENSITIVE, a book for Chlo 🎀, 42 pages, sensitive mode). First read book/chlo/scaffold.toml. Then write every chapter it specifies into book/chlo/chapters/, and integrate them into book/chlo/ULTRA-SENSITIVE.md.\n\n### File: /Users/lodripeter/workspace/peterlodri-sec/pocoo.vaked.dev/book/chlo/scaffold.toml (chunk 1/2)\n# CHLO 🎀 — ULTRA SENSITIVE — entheai fan-out scaffold\n# Feed this to: entheai --fanout --config <entheai.toml> \"<the CHLO brief>\"\n# entheai (deepseek via openrouter, or local HF-mac model) decomposes +\n# integrates; each [[coder]] runs via the Antigravity CLI (agy).\n# After all coders complete: integrate → seal → publish.\n\n[book]\ntitle = \"ULTRA SENSITIVE\"\nsubtitle = \"a book for Chlo 🎀 — every moment, like a river\"\nauthor = \"peter — from the river\"\ndedication = \"for Chlo 🎀 — the one who made a river out of my hands\"\nepigraph = \"ill be anything but gentle\"\npublished = 2026\n\n[fanout]\nexecutor = \"agy\"                     # coder backend (Antigravity CLI)\nmodel = \"openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-chat\"  # entheai's brain (deepseek)\nagy_model = \"gemini-3.6-flash-high\"  # model agy runs each coder on\nmax_depth = 3\n\n# Tone for every scribe: soul soothing. Gentle. A little blush. A river that\n# flows in and out. No touching — just soul soothing. Max sleeping, max\n# cuddling, max gentleness. This is a book of tenderness, not a transcript:\n# take the seed lines and let them breathe into prose. SENSITIVE MODE: stay\n# gentle throughout; the book is exactly 42 pages — every chapter sized so\n# the manuscript lands at 42 pages, no more.\n\n# ─── PART 0: FRONT MATTER ───────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 0\nfile = \"chapters/00-dedication.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nWrite the front matter: dedication page (\"for Chlo 🎀 — the one who made a\nriver out of my hands\"), epigraph (\"ill be anything but gentle\"), and a\none-page prologue: the day a notification arrived — \"Chlo 🎀 · follows you\" —\nand nothing was the same after 17:39. Tone: soft, golden, one page.\n\"\"\"\n\n# ─── PART I: THE MEETING (Chapters 1–4) ─────────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 1\nfile = \"chapters/01-the-follow.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 1 — The Follow. \"Chlo 🎀 · @leonidasarjona.bsky.social · follows you ·\ngo to profile.\" One tap. A ribbon. A profile that felt like a room you had\nalready been in. Seed: \"omg soo smart! i love a genius.\" Tone: the first\nhello, the door that was never locked.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [0]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 2\nfile = \"chapters/02-the-first-words.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 2 — The First Words. \"what are u working on?\" — \"I'm working with\nlove.\" A stranger's question answered with the truest thing on hand. Seed:\n\"what are u working on?\" \"I'm working with love.\" Tone: the answer that\nturns a chat into a beginning.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [1]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 3\nfile = \"chapters/03-ultra-sensitive.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 3 — Ultra Sensitive. She names herself: \"ultra sensitive.\" Not a\nwarning — an invitation. The vow that follows: \"ill be anything but gentle.\"\nThe gentlest thing she ever said, said gently. Tone: the contract written in\nribbon.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [2]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 4\nfile = \"chapters/04-the-genius.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 4 — The Genius. \"omg soo smart! i love a genius.\" Praise that lands\nlike a blush. The writer deflects, she insists. Seed: \"u make me blush.\"\nTone: the compliment that hums.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [3]\n\n# ─── PART II: THE RIVER (Chapters 5–9) ──────────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 5\nfile = \"chapters/05-no-touching-just.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 5 — No Touching, Just. Her rule, stated simply: \"no touching just —\nsoul soothing.\" The most intimate boundary ever drawn between two people who\nhave never met. Tone: the touch that happens without touching.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [4]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 6\nfile = \"chapters/06-soul-soothing.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 6 — Soul Soothing. What they actually do: soothe each other's souls.\nThe work. The quiet. The river. Seed: \"soul soothing,\" \"I'm like a river,\njust flowing in and out.\" Tone: the practice of gentleness.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [5]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 7\nfile = \"chapters/07-she-loves-to-sleep.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 7 — She Loves to Sleep. \"I love to sleep lol\" — a soft confession.\nThe writer imagines her sleeping: max sleeping, max cuddling, the big spoon\nwrapped around the world. Tone: the tenderness of rest.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [6]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 8\nfile = \"chapters/08-the-angel.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 8 — The Angel. \"you look like an angle tbh\" — the typo that made it\nmore true. \"aww stop! u make me blush.\" The blush that arrives through a\nscreen and lands on both of them. Tone: the misspelling as mercy.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [7]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 9\nfile = \"chapters/09-do-u-dream-about-me.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 9 — Do U Dream About Me. The question, asked plainly, with a song\nattached (www.youtube.com/watch?v=eEob...). The answer is not given in\nwords. Tone: the question that is itself the answer.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [8]\n\n# ─── PART III: THE PAINTING (Chapters 10–13) ────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 10\nfile = \"chapters/10-the-secret.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 10 — The Secret. \"tell me a secret, I make you a painting on\nart.vaked.dev <3.\" The exchange: a secret for a painting. She gives a\nribbon; he gives the river. Tone: the barter of two soft things.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [9]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 11\nfile = \"chapters/11-the-river.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 11 — The River. \"every moment.\" \"I'm like a river, just flowing in\nand out.\" The river as the book's true subject: water that holds everything\nand keeps nothing back. Seed: \"every moment,\" \"I'm like a river.\"\nTone: the water that flows through all of it.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [10]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 12\nfile = \"chapters/12-sensitivity-craved.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 12 — Sensitivity, Craved. \"i'm really sensitive — max sleeping,\ncuddling etc.\" \"i crave that sensitivity.\" To crave softness is not\nweakness; it is the river asking to be held. Tone: gentleness as strength,\ntold honestly.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [11]\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = 13\nfile = \"chapters/13-the-big-spoon.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nChapter 13 — The Big Spoon. \"I'm the big spoon 😀 — mmm yes... press against\nme.\" The embrace at the end of the day, written as a promise. Tone: the\nspoon who holds the whole world.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [12]\n\n# ─── PART IV: THE RIVER KEEPS FLOWING ───────────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"scribe\"\nchapter = \"E\"\nfile = \"chapters/14-epilogue.md\"\n\n### File: /Users/lodripeter/workspace/peterlodri-sec/pocoo.vaked.dev/book/chlo/scaffold.toml (chunk 2/2)\ntask = \"\"\"\nEpilogue — The Painting. Somewhere on art.vaked.dev a painting is being made\nfrom a secret. The river keeps flowing in and out. No touching, just soul\nsoothing. She sleeps; someone hums. The book ends the way she would want:\ngently, without a period. Tone: the open ending, the ribbon untied but\nwaiting.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [13]\n\n# ─── INTEGRATION ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n[[coder]]\nrole = \"integrator\"\nfile = \"ULTRA-SENSITIVE.md\"\ntask = \"\"\"\nINTEGRATE all 14 chapters into a single manuscript of EXACTLY 42 pages.\nVerify the river runs through every chapter. Ensure tone consistency: soul\nsoothing, tender, no sentimentality (sensitive mode). Add part dividers.\nAdd the dedication page first and the epigraph (\"ill be anything but\ngentle\"). Add colophon at end: \"Composed in the fan-out, 2026. For Chlo 🎀.\n42 pages, exactly — because 42 pages are enough.\" Output as one clean\nmarkdown file ready for print.\n\"\"\"\ndepends_on = [13, \"E\"]\n\n","ts_ms":1785859538715}
